sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User taps link
  participant OS as iOS / Android
  participant W as Your web server
  participant A as App
  U->>OS: https://example.com/orders/42
  OS->>W: Fetch apple-app-site-association / assetlinks.json
  W-->>OS: App ID is allowed for this domain
  OS->>A: Open app with URL
  Note over A: Cold start: getInitialURL. Warm: url event
  A->>A: Match linking config / Expo Router path
  A->>A: Navigate to /orders/[id] with id = 42
